WEBVTT

1
00:00:30.375 --> 00:00:33.291
In the previous verse, Lord Krishna said

2
00:00:33.291 --> 00:00:37.375
that for a yogi, mud, stone, and gold

3
00:00:37.375 --> 00:00:39.083
are all equal.

4
00:00:39.083 --> 00:00:40.458
Now in this verse,

5
00:00:40.458 --> 00:00:43.125
Lord Krishna is raising the
 level of this explanation

6
00:00:43.125 --> 00:00:45.708
by saying that for a true yogi,

7
00:00:45.708 --> 00:00:48.958
all human beings are also the same.

8
00:00:53.875 --> 00:00:56.208
Lord Krishna says in this verse

9
00:00:56.208 --> 00:00:59.041
that in yoga, that person is superior
 and praiseworthy

10
00:00:59.041 --> 00:01:04.208
who behaves impartially with their friends, 
acquaintances, and enemies.

11
00:01:04.208 --> 00:01:06.833
Who sees supporters and opponents,

12
00:01:06.833 --> 00:01:11.291
virtuous and sinful, all equally.

13
00:01:11.291 --> 00:01:13.250
In the previous verse, seeing mud, stone,

14
00:01:13.250 --> 00:01:16.250
and gold equally was discussed,

15
00:01:16.250 --> 00:01:18.708
but these are material things.

16
00:01:18.708 --> 00:01:22.166
To a level, remaining neutral 
toward them is possible.

17
00:01:22.166 --> 00:01:25.666
But if it's about people, seeing every behavior,

18
00:01:25.666 --> 00:01:26.708
every relationship,

19
00:01:26.708 --> 00:01:29.041
every person equally

20
00:01:29.041 --> 00:01:31.291
becomes extremely difficult.

21
00:01:31.291 --> 00:01:33.875
Lord Krishna says that an advanced yogi

22
00:01:33.875 --> 00:01:39.291
keeps their personal feelings neutral 
about any other person.

23
00:01:39.291 --> 00:01:40.291
This verse mentions

24
00:01:40.291 --> 00:01:42.625
many types of people –

25
00:01:42.625 --> 00:01:47.458
well-wishers, friends, 
enemies, relatives, saints, sinners.

26
00:01:47.458 --> 00:01:51.416
All of these play different roles in our lives.

27
00:01:51.416 --> 00:01:52.916
Someone cooperates,

28
00:01:52.916 --> 00:01:54.666
someone causes harm.

29
00:01:54.666 --> 00:01:57.708
Someone loves us, someone hates.

30
00:01:57.708 --> 00:01:58.791
But still,

31
00:01:58.791 --> 00:02:00.041
a superior yogi

32
00:02:00.041 --> 00:02:02.833
sees all of them with the same vision.

33
00:02:02.833 --> 00:02:06.083
Because one who is advanced 
on the spiritual path

34
00:02:06.083 --> 00:02:10.541
considers profit and loss, 
pleasure and pain, etc., as equal.

35
00:02:10.541 --> 00:02:11.541
Such a yogi doesn't weigh

36
00:02:11.541 --> 00:02:13.291
other people on the scale of

37
00:02:13.291 --> 00:02:15.875
whether they will give pleasure or pain,

38
00:02:15.875 --> 00:02:19.291
bring profit or harm.

39
00:02:19.291 --> 00:02:20.333
In ordinary life,

40
00:02:20.333 --> 00:02:24.750
we evaluate others based on
 closeness, wealth, property,

41
00:02:24.750 --> 00:02:26.500
social status, usefulness,

42
00:02:26.500 --> 00:02:28.541
etc.

43
00:02:28.541 --> 00:02:31.000
But one who has conquered the mind knows

44
00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:34.333
that ultimately all these standards are also

45
00:02:34.333 --> 00:02:38.250
connected to pleasure and pain, profit and loss.

46
00:02:38.250 --> 00:02:40.500
One who is close will cooperate;

47
00:02:40.500 --> 00:02:43.166
one who is not a friend can cause harm;

48
00:02:43.166 --> 00:02:45.083
one who is high on the social ladder

49
00:02:45.083 --> 00:02:47.541
can prove helpful in the future.

50
00:02:47.541 --> 00:02:49.541
Even with family members,

51
00:02:49.541 --> 00:02:52.541
there is an indirect attachment

52
00:02:52.541 --> 00:02:54.416
that they will give love.

53
00:02:54.416 --> 00:02:59.041
However, one who has risen above attachments,
above pleasure and pain, profit and loss,

54
00:02:59.041 --> 00:03:02.250
for them these people also become equal.

55
00:03:02.250 --> 00:03:05.041
Such a yogi has neither attachment
 nor aversion in their mind,

56
00:03:05.041 --> 00:03:07.791
so it makes no difference to them

57
00:03:07.791 --> 00:03:11.166
whether a person is friend or enemy, good

58
00:03:11.166 --> 00:03:12.375
or bad.

59
00:03:12.375 --> 00:03:13.416
Now think –

60
00:03:13.416 --> 00:03:16.500
such a person is becoming free
 from all their chains,

61
00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:20.291
whether they are material chains
 of wealth and property,

62
00:03:20.291 --> 00:03:22.583
or emotional chains of 
cooperation and non-cooperation, 

63
00:03:22.583 --> 00:03:26.833
friendship and enmity.

64
00:03:26.833 --> 00:03:28.541
And one who is becoming free

65
00:03:28.541 --> 00:03:33.416
is the one who can freely move
 forward on the spiritual path. 

66
00:03:33.416 --> 00:03:34.416
Because,

67
00:03:34.416 --> 00:03:39.708
they are rising above every
 obstacle that comes on this path.

68
00:03:44.541 --> 00:03:46.375
In this world,

69
00:03:46.375 --> 00:03:51.666
a person gives a name to every relationship:

70
00:03:51.666 --> 00:03:56.458
friend, enemy, colleague, family member, etc.

71
00:03:56.458 --> 00:04:01.208
And with every name,
 attaches different expectations.

72
00:04:01.208 --> 00:04:04.000
Expectation of help from friends,

73
00:04:04.000 --> 00:04:06.791
fear of harm from enemies.

74
00:04:06.791 --> 00:04:08.625
On one hand, keeps emotional expectations

75
00:04:08.625 --> 00:04:10.958
from family members,

76
00:04:10.958 --> 00:04:15.333
while doesn't have such hopes from colleagues.

77
00:04:15.333 --> 00:04:16.875
And in this way,

78
00:04:16.875 --> 00:04:20.000
they keep evaluating others.

79
00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:22.416
"My friend is a good person";

80
00:04:22.416 --> 00:04:25.625
"My enemy is a bad person."

81
00:04:25.625 --> 00:04:28.333
But the truth is,

82
00:04:28.333 --> 00:04:31.708
if every person has some flaws,

83
00:04:31.708 --> 00:04:35.500
they certainly also have some good qualities.

84
00:04:35.500 --> 00:04:37.666
And if everyone has

85
00:04:37.666 --> 00:04:40.916
both aspects – then

86
00:04:40.916 --> 00:04:42.750
on what basis does a person declare

87
00:04:42.750 --> 00:04:50.750
these definitions of good and bad, high and low?

88
00:04:50.750 --> 00:04:53.875
It's only human ego

89
00:04:53.875 --> 00:04:56.375
that what I like is good,

90
00:04:56.375 --> 00:05:00.083
what I dislike is bad.

91
00:05:00.083 --> 00:05:02.750
This is a very big mistake,

92
00:05:02.750 --> 00:05:06.375
because in most circumstances, good and bad

93
00:05:06.375 --> 00:05:07.625
are not in the person,

94
00:05:07.625 --> 00:05:11.041
but in your perspective.

95
00:05:11.041 --> 00:05:14.541
The truth is that everyone is the same.

96
00:05:14.541 --> 00:05:17.125
So change your perspective.

97
00:05:17.125 --> 00:05:20.000
Also think about this –

98
00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:23.166
indirectly, every person

99
00:05:23.166 --> 00:05:27.416
is helping in your spiritual upliftment.

100
00:05:27.416 --> 00:05:30.083
The well-wisher teaches love.

101
00:05:30.083 --> 00:05:33.166
In contact with one who is against you,

102
00:05:33.166 --> 00:05:36.666
your gentleness is tested.

103
00:05:36.666 --> 00:05:38.875
From such circumstances you learn

104
00:05:38.875 --> 00:05:42.250
to keep your calm nature firm,

105
00:05:42.250 --> 00:05:45.708
to gain control over restlessness.

106
00:05:45.708 --> 00:05:47.333
Adverse circumstances

107
00:05:47.333 --> 00:05:50.125
and people are also extremely valuable.

108
00:05:50.125 --> 00:05:52.375
See everyone impartially,

109
00:05:52.375 --> 00:05:55.041
see them rising above good and bad.

110
00:05:55.041 --> 00:05:55.916
And yes,

111
00:05:55.916 --> 00:05:58.583
the main purpose here is that

112
00:05:58.583 --> 00:06:01.208
you personally become more peaceful

113
00:06:01.208 --> 00:06:02.875
and aware.

114
00:06:02.875 --> 00:06:05.291
The purpose here is never

115
00:06:05.291 --> 00:06:10.041
to silently endure injustice and wrongdoing.

116
00:06:10.041 --> 00:06:14.375
One must speak out against the
unjust and immoral.

117
00:06:14.375 --> 00:06:17.000
But internally you will

118
00:06:17.000 --> 00:06:19.625
not be disturbed.

119
00:06:24.125 --> 00:06:26.666
In a family, everyone's thoughts

120
00:06:26.666 --> 00:06:28.916
and expectations are different.

121
00:06:28.916 --> 00:06:32.666
In such a case, sometimes
 having tension and discord

122
00:06:32.666 --> 00:06:34.375
is natural.

123
00:06:34.375 --> 00:06:36.500
But many times

124
00:06:36.500 --> 00:06:39.416
these small tensions grow.

125
00:06:39.416 --> 00:06:43.583
A crack develops between family members

126
00:06:43.583 --> 00:06:47.000
from which ultimately relationships break.

127
00:06:47.000 --> 00:06:50.958
Many times even love turns into hatred.

128
00:06:50.958 --> 00:06:54.583
Think about it – most small disputes

129
00:06:54.583 --> 00:06:58.833
take a monstrous form only because of ego.

130
00:06:58.833 --> 00:06:59.666
Because

131
00:06:59.666 --> 00:07:01.500
a person thinks

132
00:07:01.500 --> 00:07:03.583
that only I am right,

133
00:07:03.583 --> 00:07:06.625
others should behave according to me,

134
00:07:06.625 --> 00:07:08.708
my expectations are more

135
00:07:08.708 --> 00:07:10.375
important than others'.

136
00:07:10.375 --> 00:07:13.708
To gain control over such ego,

137
00:07:13.708 --> 00:07:18.291
you will have to conquer your mind.

138
00:07:18.291 --> 00:07:22.916
To create peace and harmony 
in the family, it's essential

139
00:07:22.916 --> 00:07:25.708
that a person changes their perspective

140
00:07:25.708 --> 00:07:28.375
and gains control over ego.

141
00:07:28.375 --> 00:07:32.250
And control over ego means

142
00:07:32.250 --> 00:07:37.166
that a person changes themselves, not others.

143
00:07:37.166 --> 00:07:40.041
For this, two things are essential:

144
00:07:40.041 --> 00:07:41.708
First –

145
00:07:41.708 --> 00:07:45.041
know that just like you,

146
00:07:45.041 --> 00:07:49.875
everyone has their own expectations,
 their own behavior.

147
00:07:49.875 --> 00:07:51.750
So it's natural

148
00:07:51.750 --> 00:07:55.708
that they won't always act according to you.

149
00:07:55.708 --> 00:07:58.416
This thought will calm you.

150
00:07:58.416 --> 00:07:59.666
Second thing –

151
00:07:59.666 --> 00:08:03.250
keep moving forward on the path of spirituality.

152
00:08:03.250 --> 00:08:04.791
Through this alone

153
00:08:04.791 --> 00:08:06.041
you will conquer the mind

154
00:08:06.041 --> 00:08:08.708
and ego.

155
00:08:08.708 --> 00:08:10.583
You will know that true

156
00:08:10.583 --> 00:08:12.583
joy is not in receiving something

157
00:08:12.583 --> 00:08:15.958
from family members, but in offering them

158
00:08:15.958 --> 00:08:19.958
your selfless love.

159
00:08:19.958 --> 00:08:23.708
Think – how sweet an imagination this is.

160
00:08:23.708 --> 00:08:27.208
Where you don't keep expectations 
from family members,

161
00:08:27.208 --> 00:08:33.083
but are always ready for help and love.

162
00:08:37.625 --> 00:08:39.500
In the professional world,

163
00:08:39.500 --> 00:08:44.041
many people with different
 perspectives work together.

164
00:08:44.041 --> 00:08:47.083
Here relationships are ordinarily

165
00:08:47.083 --> 00:08:49.333
not emotional either.

166
00:08:49.333 --> 00:08:53.000
In such a case, you will meet
 many types of people.

167
00:08:53.000 --> 00:08:56.041
Some who will disagree with you,

168
00:08:56.041 --> 00:08:57.750
some who will be in continuous competition

169
00:08:57.750 --> 00:09:00.000
to get ahead of you,

170
00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:03.541
some who will criticize your work.

171
00:09:03.541 --> 00:09:04.916
If you start getting disturbed

172
00:09:04.916 --> 00:09:08.125
by every adverse reaction,

173
00:09:08.125 --> 00:09:11.625
not only will your mental peace be broken,

174
00:09:11.625 --> 00:09:14.291
but it will also have a harmful effect

175
00:09:14.291 --> 00:09:18.125
on your professional progress.

176
00:09:18.125 --> 00:09:21.041
Because of ego, a person considers

177
00:09:21.041 --> 00:09:26.416
everyone who disagrees or
 criticizes as their enemy.

178
00:09:26.416 --> 00:09:28.958
Their attention remains focused on others

179
00:09:28.958 --> 00:09:31.708
instead of the goal,

180
00:09:31.708 --> 00:09:34.583
worrying that they might cause harm.

181
00:09:34.583 --> 00:09:37.750
And success depends on how you handle

182
00:09:37.750 --> 00:09:42.333
these complex circumstances.

183
00:09:42.333 --> 00:09:44.958
The Gita gives this very capability.

184
00:09:44.958 --> 00:09:48.833
Remember, people who disagree with you –

185
00:09:48.833 --> 00:09:51.875
it's not that they are bad,

186
00:09:51.875 --> 00:09:55.541
only their perspective is different from yours.

187
00:09:55.541 --> 00:09:58.791
What those people think, what they do,

188
00:09:58.791 --> 00:10:00.958
is their karma.

189
00:10:00.958 --> 00:10:05.583
You just remain firm on
 your actions and purpose.

190
00:10:05.583 --> 00:10:07.500
If someone criticizes,

191
00:10:07.500 --> 00:10:11.041
your benefit is not in giving them a retort,

192
00:10:11.041 --> 00:10:14.083
but in thinking about

193
00:10:14.083 --> 00:10:17.250
what you can improve.

194
00:10:17.250 --> 00:10:19.583
Remember these three things:

195
00:10:19.583 --> 00:10:23.250
Don't consider criticism as enmity.

196
00:10:23.250 --> 00:10:26.541
If there's an opportunity to learn
 something new in criticism,

197
00:10:26.541 --> 00:10:28.708
definitely learn it.

198
00:10:28.708 --> 00:10:30.958
Without getting disturbed,

199
00:10:30.958 --> 00:10:35.083
remain focused only on your actions and goal.
